1160
01:33:06,213 --> 01:33:12,338
The sound changes when it reaches the bone .

1161
01:33:14,713 --> 01:33:21,505
He put all his efforts into that scene .

1162
01:33:21,630 --> 01:33:27,755
If his parents saw how he worked , I bet they 'd have ... mixed feelings .

1163
01:33:37,047 --> 01:33:41,213
When I saw him right after Imprint ,

1164
01:33:41,338 --> 01:33:44,588
as soon as he saw my face , he was like , " Was that okay ? "

1165
01:33:48,755 --> 01:33:51,463
I went , " I don 't know . "

1166
01:33:59,255 --> 01:34:02,172
This whole bit , this scene ...

1167
01:34:06,838 --> 01:34:13,713
It was a little different from the original story .

1168
01:34:13,838 --> 01:34:17,505
What really struck me , what stayed with me

1169
01:34:17,630 --> 01:34:23,588
was the simplicity of each character in such crazy situations .

1170
01:34:23,713 --> 01:34:27,005
Things get really messed up , but they 're still simple people .

1171
01:34:27,130 --> 01:34:32,547
She changes her clothes , she follows the right steps .

1172
01:34:32,672 --> 01:34:37,422
Things go back and forth in time .

1173
01:34:37,547 --> 01:34:41,422
But she handles the simple process of cutting legs with no problem .

1174
01:34:41,547 --> 01:34:46,338
It 's not an illusion , it happens for real .

1175
01:34:46,463 --> 01:34:49,755
There was a contrast .

1176
01:34:50,547 --> 01:34:53,380
And I felt scared when I was reading it .

1177
01:34:59,380 --> 01:35:01,672
