1180
01:35:13,922 --> 01:35:19,963
That 's the power of visuals . When I see it , it makes me feel sick .

1181
01:35:20,880 --> 01:35:22,713
It 's started .

1182
01:35:24,838 --> 01:35:29,463
From this moment on , Ishibashi can 't act anymore .

1183
01:35:29,588 --> 01:35:35,588
She injects him with something . All he can do is move his hands .

1184
01:35:35,713 --> 01:35:41,838
And groan . He can just groan .

1185
01:35:43,630 --> 01:35:49,463
