1188
01:35:59,380 --> 01:36:03,547
but as it goes , Asami made him feel like he could do anything .

1189
01:36:03,672 --> 01:36:07,088
So , he was willing to move just his hands .

1190
01:36:07,213 --> 01:36:12,172
Of course , he 's an actor and he 's acting ,

1191
01:36:12,297 --> 01:36:17,672
but all his tricks and tools as an actor have been taken away from him here .

1192
01:36:17,797 --> 01:36:21,005
But he 's the main character . He has to be there .

1193
01:36:30,005 --> 01:36:33,047
Shiina never asked ...

1194
01:36:33,172 --> 01:36:38,422
why Asami was doing this .

1195
01:36:40,005 --> 01:36:47,505
But she looks most beautiful in this scene for some reason .

1196
01:36:50,630 --> 01:36:55,380
It 's interesting . Oh , he is moving his hand .

1197
01:36:59,255 --> 01:37:03,588
Did you have a special way of shooting this ?

1198
01:37:03,713 --> 01:37:06,713
No , nothing out of the ordinary .

1199
01:37:09,922 --> 01:37:15,588
But ... you know ...

1200
01:37:15,713 --> 01:37:21,463
this may sound strange , but the atmosphere on the set ...

1201
