1209
01:38:30,297 --> 01:38:35,713
She can 't help doing this , and that feeling shows on her face .

1210
01:38:35,838 --> 01:38:41,672
She kind of looks happy .

1211
01:38:42,672 --> 01:38:46,588
I think this scene turned out to be pretty great .

1212
01:38:48,255 --> 01:38:49,463
Casting was great .

1213
01:38:49,588 --> 01:38:51,922
If it wasn 't her ...

1214
01:38:52,047 --> 01:38:55,297
- It would 've been different . - I think so .

1215
01:38:55,963 --> 01:39:03,755
She is not trying to show who she is .

1216
01:39:03,880 --> 01:39:06,880
She doesn 't have any intention of doing that .

1217
01:39:18,422 --> 01:39:21,838
It looks like it took a long time to shoot this .

1218
01:39:21,963 --> 01:39:28,005
We try not to take too long to do these kinds of scenes .

1219
01:39:30,380 --> 01:39:32,630
I mean ...

1220
01:39:32,755 --> 01:39:34,713
Of course , it took more than one day .

1221
01:39:34,838 --> 01:39:40,338
For instance , in regular scenes , we 'll break on normal schedules ,

1222
01:39:40,463 --> 01:39:46,463
but we can 't just break for an hour in the middle of a painful scene .

1223
01:39:46,588 --> 01:39:51,005
Even if it 's a little rough , we have to keep moving .

1224
01:39:51,130 --> 01:39:57,713
Our camera guy wanted to add one more light here ,

1225
01:39:57,838 --> 01:40:02,213
but he knows the priority is the actors , not the lighting .

1226
01:40:02,338 --> 01:40:05,755
I don 't have to say that . He already knows .

1227
01:40:05,880 --> 01:40:10,630
In that way , we keep on going without losing the tension .

1228
01:40:10,755 --> 01:40:17,463
Of course , we shoot till very late at night .

1229
01:40:18,463 --> 01:40:23,130
You know , when you were a kid ,

1230
01:40:24,505 --> 01:40:27,672
and you were really tired at night ,

1231
01:40:27,797 --> 01:40:32,380
wasn 't it fun to stay awake just because your parents had told you not to ?

1232
01:40:32,505 --> 01:40:38,297
We 'd all start feeling excited after 2 : 00 in the morning .

1233
01:40:40,713 --> 01:40:44,588
We 're all used to being on the set ,

1234
01:40:44,713 --> 01:40:47,672
but it suddenly becomes something like a fun event .

1235
01:40:52,172 --> 01:40:57,463
We shoot scenes with some special makeup on one day ,

1236
01:40:57,588 --> 01:40:59,255
and move on to the next day .

1237
01:40:59,380 --> 01:41:02,797
Or we take a few hours ' break and move on to the next scene .

1238
01:41:02,922 --> 01:41:05,755
There 's no other way to do it .

1239
01:41:08,338 --> 01:41:13,005
There 's a consistency to her . She always has it .

1240
01:41:22,880 --> 01:41:28,422
Here 's where she starts cutting his legs .

1241
01:41:28,547 --> 01:41:35,838
This scene seemed to have had an influence on Hollywood movies .

1242
01:41:35,963 --> 01:41:38,838
The impact of the scene was so strong .

1243
01:41:39,713 --> 01:41:41,880
Yeah , Eli Roth .

1244
01:41:42,005 --> 01:41:43,838
Right . Hostel was the example .

1245
01:41:43,963 --> 01:41:49,088
They really love horror movies ,

1246
01:41:49,213 --> 01:41:54,630
so this ended up being one of their favorites .

1247
01:41:54,755 --> 01:41:59,130
It didn 't start with this movie . There were others before it .

1248
01:41:59,255 --> 01:42:03,297
But from their point of view , they really enjoyed it , I guess .

1249
01:42:08,338 --> 01:42:12,172
I wonder if there 's anyone else in America besides Eli Roth

1250
01:42:12,297 --> 01:42:14,838
who will listen to this commentary .

1251
01:42:14,963 --> 01:42:18,338
He might be watching this with Tarantino .

1252
01:42:18,463 --> 01:42:20,672
It 's difficult to imagine

1253
01:42:20,797 --> 01:42:26,338
what kind of person would listen to this .

1254
01:42:26,463 --> 01:42:30,088
But if it 's Eli , I can imagine that .

1255
01:42:30,213 --> 01:42:32,088
Can you hear me , Eli ?

1256
01:42:32,213 --> 01:42:35,380
Can you hear me ? Can you hear me , Tarantino ?

1257
01:42:44,172 --> 01:42:46,213
This scene ...

1258
01:42:49,422 --> 01:42:52,130
She 's always the same .

1259
01:42:52,255 --> 01:42:57,963
I know it 's a movie , but she 's been acting crazy for a while .

1260
01:42:58,088 --> 01:43:02,755
And she always had this way of making it all appear normal , you know ?

1261
01:43:02,880 --> 01:43:08,255
In this sequence , for example , where she puts liquid in a syringe .

1262
01:43:08,380 --> 01:43:14,422
She just does it as if it 's something she does all the time in real life .

1263
01:43:22,047 --> 01:43:24,713
Oh , no ... That 's bad .

1264
01:43:28,672 --> 01:43:32,005
The sound effects were great in this . The sound of the cutting .

1265
01:43:33,672 --> 01:43:36,047
She 's smiling innocently .

1266
01:43:43,463 --> 01:43:47,297
- That looks incredible . - It 's classic .

1267
01:43:47,422 --> 01:43:49,797
This was great .

1268
01:43:55,588 --> 01:43:58,547
How was the special makeup done for this scene ?

1269
01:43:58,672 --> 01:44:04,713
Matsui did the makeup . I work with him a lot .

1270
01:44:04,838 --> 01:44:11,463
He 's weird , too . It 's like his life wears special makeup .

1271
01:44:11,588 --> 01:44:13,713
But he 's wonderful .

1272
01:44:14,963 --> 01:44:22,880
We offered him this gig with very little time or budget ,

1273
01:44:25,422 --> 01:44:32,797
but he doesn 't think about that stuff , he just concentrates on doing his best .

1274
01:44:43,880 --> 01:44:49,588
I heard that in Japan and some other countries ,

1275
01:44:49,713 --> 01:44:56,713
sometimes people would walk out because of this scene .

1276
01:44:56,838 --> 01:45:02,963
Yeah , there were always some at the festivals .

1277
01:45:03,088 --> 01:45:05,922
Some people came without knowing what kind of movie it was .

1278
01:45:06,047 --> 01:45:09,088
They thought it was about an audition .

1279
01:45:11,505 --> 01:45:16,713
There were some who couldn 't take it even if they knew what it was about .

1280
01:45:16,838 --> 01:45:22,547
One time , I was at a festival and I was watching it with an audience ,

1281
01:45:22,672 --> 01:45:27,130
and this person walked up to me and said , " You 're sick . " "

1282
01:45:27,255 --> 01:45:31,922
In English , of course . She had to say that to me .

1283
01:45:32,047 --> 01:45:37,672
When she left , the audience around me started clapping .

1284
01:45:39,380 --> 01:45:42,505
They were like , " She left ! You 're sick !

1285
01:45:42,630 --> 01:45:47,130
1 " - You 're sick ! You 're one of us ! "

1286
01:45:47,255 --> 01:45:50,755
They were like that .

1287
01:45:52,672 --> 01:45:57,338
I think it 's natural to have different reactions .

1288
01:45:57,463 --> 01:46:03,338
When we sit in the dark , we have our own preferences .

1289
01:46:03,463 --> 01:46:06,297
We have our own favourites .

1290
01:46:06,422 --> 01:46:11,297
But there is a tendency to try to make films

1291
01:46:11,422 --> 01:46:13,797
that everybody can enjoy and cry together over .

1292
01:46:13,922 --> 01:46:16,130
To me , that 's unnatural .

1293
01:46:16,255 --> 01:46:22,380
I went through all kinds of criticism at many different festivals ,

1294
01:46:22,505 --> 01:46:25,297
and I think ...

1295
01:46:27,088 --> 01:46:33,463
We should all make different movies . That 's the way to go .

1296
01:46:39,047 --> 01:46:42,213
In that sense , this movie was very successful ...

1297
01:46:43,630 --> 01:46:46,588
since you got such a variety of reactions .

1298
01:46:46,713 --> 01:46:53,380
I think the audience 's feelings and reactions are stronger in a theatre .

1299
01:46:53,505 --> 01:46:59,755
It 's scary to watch my own films with audiences .

1300
01:46:59,880 --> 01:47:06,963
When it 's for foreigners , I don 't know how it 's being translated or conveyed .

1301
01:47:07,088 --> 01:47:14,505
Some folks get mad , but others enjoy it a lot .

1302
01:47:15,672 --> 01:47:20,088
The reactions of the audience are always diverse .

1303
01:47:20,213 --> 01:47:24,505
It 's completely different at each and every festival .

1304
01:47:24,630 --> 01:47:28,672
You can feel it right there .

1305
01:47:28,797 --> 01:47:34,088
That 's one reason I find my job as a director so fascinating .

1306
01:47:35,088 --> 01:47:38,630
Have you watched your films with theatre audiences ?

1307
01:47:38,755 --> 01:47:40,630
Yes .

1308
01:47:40,755 --> 01:47:44,463
- It 's not comfortable . - It 's uncomfortable .

1309
01:47:45,505 --> 01:47:49,338
Yeah , it makes me very restless ,

1310
01:47:49,463 --> 01:47:55,047
and I feel that way whether they like it or not .

1311
01:47:55,172 --> 01:48:00,505
I would probably feel better if someone told me , " You 're sick . "

1312
01:48:00,630 --> 01:48:04,505
I really was scolded by this middle-aged lady .

1313
01:48:06,088 --> 01:48:08,380
That 's funny .

1314
01:48:15,547 --> 01:48:23,297
In Hollywood , they love remakes . They love to remake old movies .

1315
01:48:23,422 --> 01:48:28,838
Several Japanese horror movies have been remade in America and other places .

1316
01:48:28,963 --> 01:48:32,880
Have you received any offers like that ?

1317
01:48:33,005 --> 01:48:35,880
Yes , I have , frequently .

1318
01:48:36,005 --> 01:48:39,547
Over there ...

1319
01:48:39,672 --> 01:48:47,505
they don 't want to miss anything they see as having potential .

1320
01:48:48,338 --> 01:48:52,380
But it 's about timing .

1321
01:48:54,755 --> 01:48:57,172
Good timing or bad timing .

1322
01:48:57,297 --> 01:49:02,172
And I think , for this film ...

1323
01:49:03,838 --> 01:49:11,172
I think it matches the story to have Asian characters .

1324
01:49:12,880 --> 01:49:18,130
If they were to remake this film in America ,

1325
01:49:19,047 --> 01:49:23,630
it could become something completely different .

1326
01:49:25,922 --> 01:49:27,880
There she goes .

1327
01:49:49,630 --> 01:49:57,005
Have you had offers to direct movies in other countries ?

1328
01:49:57,130 --> 01:49:59,005
Yes .

1329
01:50:00,172 --> 01:50:06,047
Do you have any plans to do something like that ?

1330
01:50:06,172 --> 01:50:13,047
Oh , definitely . It depends on my schedule .

1331
01:50:13,172 --> 01:50:15,380
For one thing ...

1332
01:50:17,047 --> 01:50:19,672
I think ...

1333
01:50:21,255 --> 01:50:25,838
the pay would be much better than it is in Japan .

1334
01:50:27,130 --> 01:50:33,297
But we have different philosophies about filmmaking schedules and time .

1335
01:50:33,422 --> 01:50:38,713
Going over there would be like selling one or two years ' worth of my time .

1336
01:50:38,838 --> 01:50:44,005
I just can 't get used to the idea .

1337
01:50:44,130 --> 01:50:50,005
We 've negotiated but not agreed , and the projects fade away .

1338
01:50:53,547 --> 01:50:56,880
Do you mean that you have to start committing your time

1339
01:50:57,005 --> 01:51:01,213
once you 've accepted a project , even before shooting begins ?

1340
01:51:01,338 --> 01:51:05,547
I just feel scared that my freedom will be taken away .

1341
01:51:05,672 --> 01:51:10,838
Also , it looks tough . A lot of people are watching you in Hollywood .

1342
01:51:10,963 --> 01:51:13,588
You have to show rushes to the guys in suits .

1343
01:51:13,713 --> 01:51:16,588
And I like the privilege of final cut .

1344
01:51:16,713 --> 01:51:24,213
So , I 'm just not sure if that 's where I want to go as a director .

1345
01:51:36,547 --> 01:51:40,297
So , 10 years have passed .

1346
01:51:42,088 --> 01:51:43,880
Time flies .

1347
01:51:45,588 --> 01:51:50,630
When you see this film that you made 10 years ago ,

1348
01:51:50,755 --> 01:51:55,255
do you have a different impression than you did before ?

1349
01:51:55,380 --> 01:51:57,422
What do you think ?

1350
01:51:59,213 --> 01:52:04,297
It 's well-balanced in certain ways .

1351
01:52:04,422 --> 01:52:09,005
I think there was a good balance among the actors , the crew ,

1352
01:52:09,130 --> 01:52:13,713
the director and me .

1353
01:52:15,130 --> 01:52:17,672
That had to help .

1354
01:52:17,797 --> 01:52:22,588
If there wasn 't a good balance , it would have turned out differently .

1355
01:52:26,380 --> 01:52:32,088
I think there are things you can make only at certain times .

1356
01:52:32,213 --> 01:52:38,422
I don 't have any complaints watching it now .

1357
01:52:41,588 --> 01:52:49,338
It does feel a little like watching somebody else 's film

1358
01:52:49,463 --> 01:52:54,797
when I see something I did 10 years ago .

1359
01:52:57,047 --> 01:53:00,172
But it 's precious .

1360
01:53:00,297 --> 01:53:04,463
I don 't want to change anything . I have no intention of changing it .

1361
01:53:09,672 --> 01:53:14,338
Can you tell me what Audition meant to you ,

1362
01:53:14,463 --> 01:53:17,880
as a director , when you think about your career ?

1363
01:53:18,005 --> 01:53:21,922
And Tengan , when you think about how your screenplay works ,

1364
01:53:22,047 --> 01:53:25,297
what does Audition mean to you ? Can you tell me ?

1365
01:53:25,422 --> 01:53:30,713
I 'm just glad that people other than Japanese movie fans

1366
01:53:30,838 --> 01:53:36,588
have watched this film , people from all over the world .

1367
01:53:38,255 --> 01:53:40,213
Cult movie fans .

1368
01:53:40,338 --> 01:53:45,963
We rented a regular house , we shot it in Japan ,

1369
01:53:46,088 --> 01:53:50,588
and it was accepted the world over just as it was .

1370
01:53:50,713 --> 01:53:53,547
I really feel that ...

1371
01:53:53,672 --> 01:53:57,130
there are a lot of things I can do in Japan .

1372
01:53:57,255 --> 01:54:02,630
I don 't have to leave Japan to do a big film that finds an audience .

1373
01:54:05,297 --> 01:54:10,838
When I go overseas and tell people I wrote Audition ...

1374
01:54:12,797 --> 01:54:16,797
some people get so excited .

1375
01:54:16,922 --> 01:54:21,088
It reminds me that so many people ...

1376
01:54:22,755 --> 01:54:27,797
from all different places have seen it .

1377
01:54:28,922 --> 01:54:36,797
I think the film has a power , and that 's led to it being so recognised .

1378
01:54:36,922 --> 01:54:39,797
I feel incredibly lucky to have been involved in it at all .

1379
01:54:41,088 --> 01:54:43,505
All right . Thank you both so much .

1380
01:54:43,630 --> 01:54:47,172
And remember , we 're working together again on our new project .

1381
01:54:48,547 --> 01:54:50,797
I 'm not sure what 's going to happen .

1382
01:54:51,922 --> 01:54:53,963
It will be allowed to be shown .

1383
01:54:54,088 --> 01:54:57,547
It better be !

